WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Far out in the ocean, a green island rises from still water.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Cloud rolls over the ridges and settles in the valleys.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The cliffs drop straight into the sea.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Everything here was shaped by the waves and the wind.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rain feeds the forest long before it reaches the shore.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
From above, the coastline looks almost untouched.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The light moves on, and the water goes dark again.
